Azman,

The d parameter is hard to interpret. Use b instead. It is called the difficulty parameter and it should behave as you expected. Not sure it will but I really liked the way you framed the problem. Please report back.

a(theta -b) = a*theta -a*b=a*theta + d

argument IRTpars will return your coefficients in b format...

coef(mod_mt,simplify=TRUE,IRTpars = TRUE)

Good luck!

Hugo

