Hi Guido,

Validating items is more art than science. The more you use these statistics you will notice that very often they will reject perfectly fine/acceptable items. It is also very common to have conflicting diagnostics depending on the stats you use. Use them all and use them as a heads-up for you to look for adjustments issues but I would not recommend  using them to reject items. All plot the curves and check adjustments. Use itemplot profusely!! ;-)

This list has many threads that will recommend such an approach.

Regards,

Hugo

